# Build Output

- Do not commit build artifacts as source of truth.
- Production: minify, tree-shake, dead-code eliminate.
- Budgets from `project-context` + Web Vitals; exceed → measure → report → optimize or get approval.
- Prefer named/path imports; hash static assets; don’t ship huge raw media.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/runtime/build-output.md`
